sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as nova-api
    participant P as Policy engine
    participant K as Keystone authz API
    C->>S: DELETE /servers/id<br/>Bearer JWT, OpenStack-Target: project=P
    S->>S: verify JWT offline<br/>load server, owner = P
    S->>P: credentials, target scope, operation
    P->>P: requested target must equal resource owner
    P->>K: POST /v4/authz/check<br/>(no cross-request cache)
    K-->>P: allowed via role:admin@domain:inherited<br/>version, lag_ms
    P-->>S: allow
    S-->>C: 204
